{"data": {"node": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "26487177984247249", "organization": {"id": "1229267295066682", "viewer_permissions": [], "application_groupings": {"nodes": [{"viewer_has_update_access": false, "full_applications": {"nodes": [{"id": "26487177984247249"}]}, "id": "1512612960324015"}]}}, "firstRevision": {"nodes": [{"application": {"id": "26487177984247249", "release_date": 1776264360, "is_concept": false, "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF", "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "26584825394482507"}, "id": "1444631510761262"}]}}, "binary": null, "live_binary": null, "created_date": 1776314828, "id": "26591796333785413", "is_initial_release": false, "name_with_fallback": "v2", "pdp_metadata_with_fallback": {"version": 2, "application": {"is_concept": false, "latest_released_pdp_metadata": {"id": "26591816440450069"}, "release_status": "RELEASED", "id": "26487177984247249"}, "id": "26591816440450069", "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED"}, "release_date": null, "administration_status": "APPROVED", "is_first": false, "release_status": "RELEASED", "release_type": "SCHEDULED", "pdp_metadata": {"application": {"default_locale": "en_US", "id": "26487177984247249", "is_first_party": false, "enables_in_app_ads": false, "is_concept": false, "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF"}, "iarc_cert": {"id": "1568259901589334"}, "iarc_email": null, "msrp": null, "translations": {"nodes": [{"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "26603173859303022", "locale": "de_DE", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Bams Solitaire VR", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Willkommen an Ihrem pers\u00f6nlichen virtuellen Strand. Entfliehen Sie dem Alltag mit Bams Solitaire VR!\n\nBams Solitaire VR verwandelt das klassische Kartenspiel in einen entspannenden Kurzurlaub. Stellen Sie sich vor: Sie sitzen an einer ruhigen Bucht, \u00fcber Ihnen leuchtet der Sternenhimmel, sanftes Meeresrauschen umgibt Sie, und aus einem kleinen Strandradio klingt entspannte Musik. Vor Ihnen schwebt Ihr Solit\u00e4r-Spiel direkt \u00fcber den sanften Wellen.\n\n**Maritimes Design trifft auf magische Atmosph\u00e4re**\nJedes Detail wurde mit Liebe zum Meer gestaltet. Entdecken Sie unsere einzigartigen, Bildkarten \u2013 von der majest\u00e4tischen Meeresk\u00f6nigin bis hin zu Poseidon selbst.\n\n**Greifbare VR-Physik statt flacher Klicks**\nDank unserer nativen, hochperformanten Engine sp\u00fcren Sie jede Bewegung:\n* Perfektes Greifen: Greifen Sie Karten oder ganze Stapel intuitiv mit Ihren H\u00e4nden oder Controllern. Haptisches Feedback l\u00e4sst Sie das Gewicht der Karten f\u00f6rmlich sp\u00fcren.\n* Der \"Ninja Flick\": Verbringen Sie keine Zeit mit langweiligem Ablegen. Werfen Sie die Karten mit einem leichten Schwung aus dem Handgelenk quer \u00fcber den Tisch in ihre Ziel-Slots! \n* Volle Kontrolle: Ziehen Sie das gesamte Spielfeld mit den schwebenden Steuergriffen genau in die Position, die f\u00fcr Sie am bequemsten ist.\n\n**Vier Klassiker an einem Strand**\nSpielen Sie Ihre absoluten Lieblingsmodi, perfekt angepasst f\u00fcr die Virtual Reality:\n* Klondike\n* Spider\n* FreeCell\n* Pyramide", "short_description": "Entspannendes Strand-Solit\u00e4r in VR. Lausche dem sanften Meeresrauschen, greife die Karten mit deinen eigenen H\u00e4nden und genie\u00dfe die Magie."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "BSVR1440x1440.png", "id": "2265746220908120", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491820496_2265746224241453_8663149544726326029_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ZR_djDW1BkYQ7kNvwH8MxH_&_nc_oc=AdpCwiS6-k_tOSzz-XPdZppd6TmheW50F5axWRO5yxoTBUcXXcKPawdyr8xElGgP3Mc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5qjHShbcf8p_5h7WIRZQwV9ZieejAoJRZtcNM_wLjtYA&oe=69F9E903"}, {"file_name": "bams_icon.png", "id": "1853345692009190", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821674_1853345695342523_4969261726722226581_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=xHcY3YJt93oQ7kNvwGWa4LQ&_nc_oc=AdpvUn5SaCbRmVrwiNHmxauBSm85I4gOCa9j3H3ZqIFEbrjYQHMZs8AVqv0NTJh3O1M&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7_ThudYl4T6m_CQZA065Y_Mzj2c5Nt3suFOloxtXDsOg&oe=69F9F620"}, {"file_name": "BSVR1008x1440.png", "id": "1280206627403407", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823812_1280206630736740_1767039078555120883_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=jwSgSZrNM2oQ7kNvwGOHgXg&_nc_oc=AdoeqGJDFiQmb2JNBMvXRbfi1CRN2RAYstZwyNIl_I7J2717QlkfGN7pXaeKJBqlo7w&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5RValNnUb2e8CdsM_qy2-dQGkI6vPVmZkzdyFniAntqw&oe=69FA04D8"}, {"file_name": "BSVR2560x1440.png", "id": "1240424004917207", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491822327_1240424008250540_5120684943954837147_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=MFKGz7GAVqAQ7kNvwHKeOYI&_nc_oc=AdrjaqdcSgiZ3EWQGYqYGCLrAZzjEGIxImFVsvioo6PgqTtz2PScwJJEoq_K01OWWF4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af66JosZnUAVlbWJlKN4BDaefccD_0F8BIt-0VzdIMwfTg&oe=69FA0816"}, {"file_name": "Hero Art BSVR.png", "id": "933944619503893", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823802_933944626170559_4723201925290549549_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=l6MciGonVM0Q7kNvwFRwdty&_nc_oc=Adofqdr1dSfUfujUneMpvOTG042zVKLLGTvLCLLsG9WJuZzNQGV67CW-yL0QUfsuxr4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5vJEZik0Q555ysyGF6tBA2s1AkGzgK5A9khBwSL1iPPQ&oe=69F9F770"}, {"file_name": "bams_logo_meta.png", "id": "793646677155197", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821782_793646680488530_2105530370413873091_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=tLpFT-NGj78Q7kNvwE69-7a&_nc_oc=Adr9Fhzyg8yVsD1c7WieEDa9zgt7ekJQSPBY-5sLJ7jn7aNOau9phYIgpfE5O8OGtjw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5PnAFtiB-KH06eAi28hzV4s5hsPWAAV3jxNB7m5NkEeA&oe=69F9DCE9"}]}, "id": "1431119534958664", "locale": "en_US", "screenshots": [{"file_name": "ScreenshotBSVR2.png", "id": "1298204515582726", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821568_1298204518916059_8869792458384025742_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=0dVK9jfdHAYQ7kNvwHIbiie&_nc_oc=Adoggjb4XkC1Qvvzn6IV4cVvEOFi7lB_U28M8ZVI-uaW8OcecoKLLhrTB4K435AIVrw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5g5ZBBSJQu_rMy_P272U1c_8Z-A8YkmEfskwWJG9A8XA&oe=69F9E996"}, {"file_name": "ScreenshotBSVR4.png", "id": "2985541324983450", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491820855_2985541328316783_6181994284030423808_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=sM3IxalsrW0Q7kNvwG4QKxK&_nc_oc=AdpnWpiGHaV7h2WZ5tQJBLHAqMT3JP7ztEJbnI9ugloEKrMnL3RP-d__E5dBsx01tB0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5czEK5GuyIbJdG7_Hgpi7Xvh03IiSjZ6TIPSG9BO0b2A&oe=69F9F3FE"}, {"file_name": "ScreenshotBSVR5.png", "id": "26075450892156956", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821696_26075450915490287_155639571789113632_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=tg6HPUxXYrUQ7kNvwENQ1E-&_nc_oc=Adp_k3pLITpEwaEEw6RLnv2495nQP9Iw4tFz09sAbkoX54UZ39y9Q1jxQk7gu9CGaeo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4_tXQEEfNzFq-6APv1pULg626KoP3wnnshubKMJ0zjKA&oe=69FA01CF"}, {"file_name": "ScreenshotBSVR1.png", "id": "1647149749963491", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491820923_1647149753296824_4887864137137797585_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=IYWgyG4tSb4Q7kNvwGEfDrs&_nc_oc=AdpMsxa5CfRUXdn1woyrQivqB9aFiSxZXODdkYFUwNAZ0oC2hxuBDg9Gaszwug32-sc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6vbkG9xzJPbJ1MdIRbpXBb1kUt0Ke8u5ximBBqrZcPlA&oe=69F9FAE1"}, {"file_name": "ScreenshotBSVR3.png", "id": "1582692552837284", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491828104_1582692556170617_5582135335785372982_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=jyva1zE56WgQ7kNvwESRuSK&_nc_oc=AdoJvGzFpqWR4DL8SfOECzb6SllkpyiW6jgSaNwYLB9bLAxrD8wlaCKWR82EmjlttFw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5mGtMfrEsejvRT4k3emQtaksNJ7r7x8zxD5CnhDBMh0Q&oe=69F9FFB0"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "BSVR2560x1440.png", "id": "1515450013532039", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491828806_1515450016865372_2013896751602355404_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=cMUJFRDJEfIQ7kNvwFF_dKT&_nc_oc=Ado3Jetz3KhQ5EpTw3n1sdFy1_EuN47V4-0ng2MiFastAQdoItIvwTuJQpavbcX4Hzw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7a33UyOmo_i98Z5mrcmfO4Jb4vgYuSGzneEqLzh_c9pg&oe=69F9E954"}, "display_name": "Bams Solitaire VR", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Welcome to your personal virtual beach. Escape the daily grind with Bams Solitaire VR!\n\nBams Solitaire VR transforms the classic card game into a relaxing getaway. Imagine sitting by a quiet bay, the starry sky shining above you, surrounded by the gentle sound of the ocean, while relaxing music plays from a small beach radio. Right in front of you, your solitaire game floats above the gentle waves.\n\n**Maritime Design Meets Magical Atmosphere**\nEvery detail has been crafted with a love for the sea. Discover our unique, hand-drawn face cards \u2013 from the majestic Sea Queen to Poseidon himself. Play with maritime card backs and let the environment enchant you as a message in a bottle drifts in the water.\n\n**Tangible VR Physics instead of Flat Clicks**\nThanks to our native, highly performant engine, you feel every movement:\n* Perfect Grabbing: Intuitively grab cards or entire stacks with your hands or controllers. Haptic feedback lets you literally feel the weight of the cards.\n* The \"Ninja Flick\": Throw the cards across the table into their target slots with a flick of your wrist!\n* Full Control: Drag the entire playing field into the exact position that is most comfortable for you using the floating control handles.\n\n**Four Classics on One Beach**\nPlay your absolute favorite modes, perfectly adapted for Virtual Reality:\n* Klondike\n* Spider\n* FreeCell\n* Pyramid\n\n**Exclusive VR Features:**\n* Interactive Environment: Turn on the beach radio, read mysterious messages from the bottle,", "short_description": "Relaxing beach solitaire in VR. Listen to the gentle sound of the ocean, grab the cards with your own hands, and enjoy the magic."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://bams-design.ch/game/datenschutz.txt", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Bams Design", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://bams-design.ch/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1676485315806614"}, {"id": "377978390272490"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "de", "fr", "it", "es"], "supported_input_devices": ["HAND_TRACKING", "OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "SITTING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "26591816440450069"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491820496_2265746224241453_8663149544726326029_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ZR_djDW1BkYQ7kNvwH8MxH_&_nc_oc=AdpCwiS6-k_tOSzz-XPdZppd6TmheW50F5axWRO5yxoTBUcXXcKPawdyr8xElGgP3Mc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5Ovvk_x9UHyn8G9z5BVAM14_tZ1MNtK8ti0B1sDTtrPg&oe=69F9E903"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "Bams Solitaire VR", "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF", "context_category": {"context_category": "GAMES", "id": "2743326035925534"}, "context_topics": [{"topic_name": "Tabletop", "id": "1676485315806614"}, {"topic_name": "Puzzle", "id": "377978390272490"}], "release_date": 1776264360, "lastRevision": {"nodes": [{"id": "26487178037580577", "release_type": "SCHEDULED", "administration_status": "APPROVED", "pdp_metadata": {"application": {"default_locale": "en_US", "id": "26487177984247249", "is_first_party": false, "enables_in_app_ads": false, "is_concept": false, "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF"}, "iarc_cert": {"id": "1568259901589334"}, "iarc_email": null, "msrp": null, "translations": {"nodes": [{"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "965357809361260", "locale": "de_DE", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Bams Solitaire VR", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Willkommen an Ihrem pers\u00f6nlichen virtuellen Strand. Entfliehen Sie dem Alltag mit Bams Solitaire VR!\n\nBams Solitaire VR verwandelt das klassische Kartenspiel in einen entspannenden Kurzurlaub. Stellen Sie sich vor: Sie sitzen an einer ruhigen Bucht, \u00fcber Ihnen leuchtet der Sternenhimmel, sanftes Meeresrauschen umgibt Sie, und aus einem kleinen Strandradio klingt entspannte Musik. Vor Ihnen schwebt Ihr Solit\u00e4r-Spiel direkt \u00fcber den sanften Wellen.\n\n**Maritimes Design trifft auf magische Atmosph\u00e4re**\nJedes Detail wurde mit Liebe zum Meer gestaltet. Entdecken Sie unsere einzigartigen, Bildkarten \u2013 von der majest\u00e4tischen Meeresk\u00f6nigin bis hin zu Poseidon selbst.\n\n**Greifbare VR-Physik statt flacher Klicks**\nDank unserer nativen, hochperformanten Engine sp\u00fcren Sie jede Bewegung:\n* Perfektes Greifen: Greifen Sie Karten oder ganze Stapel intuitiv mit Ihren H\u00e4nden oder Controllern. Haptisches Feedback l\u00e4sst Sie das Gewicht der Karten f\u00f6rmlich sp\u00fcren.\n* Der \"Ninja Flick\": Verbringen Sie keine Zeit mit langweiligem Ablegen. Werfen Sie die Karten mit einem leichten Schwung aus dem Handgelenk quer \u00fcber den Tisch in ihre Ziel-Slots! \n* Volle Kontrolle: Ziehen Sie das gesamte Spielfeld mit den schwebenden Steuergriffen genau in die Position, die f\u00fcr Sie am bequemsten ist.\n\n**Vier Klassiker an einem Strand**\nSpielen Sie Ihre absoluten Lieblingsmodi, perfekt angepasst f\u00fcr die Virtual Reality:\n* Klondike\n* Spider\n* FreeCell\n* Pyramide", "short_description": "Entspannendes Strand-Solit\u00e4r in VR. Lausche dem sanften Meeresrauschen, greife die Karten mit deinen eigenen H\u00e4nden und genie\u00dfe die Magie."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "BSVR1440x1440.png", "id": "2265746220908120", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491820496_2265746224241453_8663149544726326029_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ZR_djDW1BkYQ7kNvwH8MxH_&_nc_oc=AdpCwiS6-k_tOSzz-XPdZppd6TmheW50F5axWRO5yxoTBUcXXcKPawdyr8xElGgP3Mc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5qjHShbcf8p_5h7WIRZQwV9ZieejAoJRZtcNM_wLjtYA&oe=69F9E903"}, {"file_name": "bams_icon.png", "id": "1853345692009190", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821674_1853345695342523_4969261726722226581_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=xHcY3YJt93oQ7kNvwGWa4LQ&_nc_oc=AdpvUn5SaCbRmVrwiNHmxauBSm85I4gOCa9j3H3ZqIFEbrjYQHMZs8AVqv0NTJh3O1M&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_